<title>AUSTRALIA: Moody's assigns AAA rating to SAM mortgage debt.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns AAA rating to SAM mortgage debt.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Tuesday that it had assigned a AAA rating to the planned A$225.1 million issue of mortgage-backed debt by the Securitised Australian Mortgage (SAM) Trust.  </p>
<p>Moody's said SAM Trust 1997-1 was the third issue under the SAM Trust established by Citibank Ltd since October 1995.</p>
<p>Funds were used to acquire a pool of mortgage loans originated by Citibank, which would also act as servicer of the sold housing loans, it said.</p>
<p>Citibank Ltd is a unit of Citicorp.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
